abstract: Analysis and benchmarking code, figure and table builders, and tracked results
  supporting the Cell Genomics submission. IsoGraph separates transcript-usage and
  abundance contributions to network organization in BrainSEQ and GTEx adult brain
  transcriptomes. The archive DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23149043 resolves to the latest
  release; the preprint DOI has not yet been assigned.
